the running program or from the Models' behaviour.

"Outputs" means anything the Models produce, including technique reads, key estimates,
probabilities, internal activations and expected-trade values.

"Sword Coach" means the Sword Coach software in this repository, including versions of its
GPL-licensed code that you or others have modified.

"Distillation" means using the Models or their Outputs, directly or indirectly, as data,
labels, a teacher or a reference for the purpose of creating, training, fine-tuning or
evaluating any other model, bot or system, including by querying the Models to reconstruct
their behaviour.


